  "description": "In this video, Sampati, a speaker of Jaunpuri, a dialect of the Garhwali language of India and a resident of Dewalsari from the Garhwal region of the Uttarakhand state, discusses the use of Aadhaar and public information access-related issues on 8 November 2019. Interviewed by Subhashish Panigrahi for the latter's 2021 documentary film, MarginalizedAadhaar. Unused or trimmed archival footage from the film was edited by Panigrahi and published as part of the OpenSpeaks Archives project in 2026. Hindi subtitles are by Arun Gour and Manoj Bilwal.",
